{marinade} <stir, bowl>
(tofu) + {marinade} <refrigerate, 30m, rectangular food container also suitable to submerge with less marinade>
{sauce} = (stock choice) + (soy sauce) remaining + (sesame oil) + (cornstarch) + (hoisin sauce)
