    <drain>
    <rinse, remaining water off as source states>
    <set aside>
(peanut oil) 2tbsp <add, same pan>
(tofu) <cook, until bottom golden brown>
    <turn>
    <cook, repeat on other side, stir a few times>
    <move, side of pan>
(peanut oil) more + (garlic) <stir, until fragrant, generally less than 1m>
